---
import { Code, User, Monitor } from 'lucide-react'
import { Card, CardContent } from '@/components/ui/card'
---

<div class="section-container">
  <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>

  <div class="grid items-start gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-6 text-lg text-gray-700">
        I'm a New Zealand native now calling Newcastle,
        England home. With over 15 years in the tech
        industry and two decades of programming experience,
        I've evolved from working as a software engineer,
        database administrator, business analyst, to now
        being in senior leadership roles where technical
        expertise and strategic vision combine.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-6 text-lg text-gray-700">
        Currently I guide teams in building robust, scalable
        solutions that solve both customer and business
        needs. My philosophy has always been that effective
        technology leadership requires both technical depth
        and a people-first mindset.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700">
        Outside the office, I'm a competitive chess player
        and D&D Dungeon Master. One of those I'm quite good
        at, the other not so much - I'll let you guess which
        is which. I'm often found training in the gym as I
        am also a qualified personal trainer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <Card className="card-hover">
        <CardContent className="p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div
              class="mt-1 rounded-full bg-orange-100 p-3"
            >
              <Code
                size={24}
                className="text-primary"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">
                Technical Leadership
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                I have a strong background in software
                engineering, architecture, and cloud
                technologies. I lead teams in building
                robust, scalable solutions that solve both
                customer and business needs.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </CardContent>
      </Card>

      <Card className="card-hover">
        <CardContent className="p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div
              class="mt-1 rounded-full bg-orange-100 p-3"
            >
              <User
                size={24}
                className="text-primary"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">
                Team Leadership
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                I believe in empowering teams to reach their
                full potential. I focus on fostering a
                culture of collaboration, innovation, and
                continuous improvement. I lead by example,
                guiding my teams to embrace challenges and
                drive success.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </CardContent>
      </Card>

      <Card className="card-hover">
        <CardContent className="p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div
              class="mt-1 rounded-full bg-orange-100 p-3"
            >
              <Monitor
                size={24}
                className="text-primary"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">
                Strategic Vision
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                I have a strong understanding of business
                strategy and how technology can drive
                growth. I work closely with stakeholders to
                align technology initiatives with business
                goals, ensuring that we deliver value to our
                customers and the organisation as a whole.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </CardContent>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
